{%- comment -%}
  PawLunova: "Worth it?" beside the price, where the "is it worth the
  money" question is actually asked (audit PDP-17: it comes up in 18 of 19
  owner threads). Paste into a Custom Liquid block under the promise block:

      {% render 'pln-worth-it', product: product %}

  Shows the product's own custom.worth_it text, written per bed, and nothing
  when the metafield is blank. Never a template sentence.
  Styles: assets/pln-pdp.css (.pln-worth).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign text = product.metafields.custom.worth_it.value
  assign owner = settings.pln_owner_name | default: 'Abbas'
-%}
{%- if text != blank -%}
{{ 'pln.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
{{ 'pln-pdp.css' | asset_url | stylesheet_tag }}
<aside class="pln-worth" aria-labelledby="pln-worth-head-{{ product.id }}">
  <p class="pln-worth__head" id="pln-worth-head-{{ product.id }}">Worth it?</p>
  <div class="pln-worth__body">{{ text | newline_to_br }}</div>
  <p class="pln-worth__who">{{ owner }}, {{ shop.name }}</p>
</aside>
{%- endif -%}
